## In the original words

> Не нужно искусственно гнаться за 6000 слов, нужно гнаться за максимально качественно раскрытыми и максимально обоснованными тезисами

*Do not artificially chase 6,000 words; pursue theses developed and defended as well as possible.* — [September 8, 2026](docs/quotes.md#q10).

The [61 excerpts](docs/quotes.md) preserve the human side of the work: ambitions, choices, jokes, and frustration with the software. Each links to its full prompt.

---

The guide is in English; conversations retain their original language. Five Russian essays have English reading translations alongside the originals. Reviewer profiles are sourced experiments whose fidelity remains unvalidated; capture gaps are documented in the [record](docs/provenance.md).

This edition remains private during the competition. [Next steps](ROADMAP.md) · [Publication and language policy](PUBLICATION.md) · [Verify the files](tools/verify_edition.py)
